+    * Train the coarse model for a fixed number of epochs (e.g., 5 epochs) [S2].
+    * **Sampling:** For each ray, sample points $x_i$ using step size $\delta^{(c)}$:
         $$ x_0 = o + t^{(\text{near})} d $$
